- content_for :page_header do
  = render "layouts/components/page_header", title: "Cuisine"

= render "kitchen/settings_tabs"

.max-w-3xl.space-y-6
  p.text-sm.text-gray-500
    | Ce que Claudy propose au moment de composer un séjour. Une famille retirée
      de l'offre disparaît des sélecteurs sans toucher aux demandes déjà prises.
      Les plafonds et les délais avertissent — ils ne bloquent jamais.

  = form_with url: kitchen_settings_path, method: :patch, class: "space-y-5" do
    - Kitchen::Config.families.each do |family|
      - key = family[:key]
      - enabled = Kitchen::Config.enabled?(key)
      section.bg-white.rounded-2xl.ring-1.ring-gray-200.overflow-hidden data-controller="kitchen-family"
        header.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4.px-5.py-4.border-b.border-gray-100(class="bg-gray-50/60")
          div.min-w-0
            h2.text-base.font-semibold.text-gray-900 = family[:label]
            p.mt-0.5.text-sm.text-gray-500 = family[:hint]
          label.flex.shrink-0.items-center.gap-2.text-sm.font-medium.text-gray-700.cursor-pointer
            = hidden_field_tag "kitchen[#{key}][enabled]", "0"
            = check_box_tag "kitchen[#{key}][enabled]", "1", enabled, class: "h-4 w-4 rounded border-gray-300 text-4s-main focus:ring-4s-main", data: { kitchen_family_target: "toggle", action: "change->kitchen-family#refresh" }
            span Proposée

        .px-5.py-4.grid.grid-cols-1.gap-4.sm:grid-cols-3.transition-opacity data-kitchen-family-target="fields"
          div
            = label_tag "kitchen[#{key}][default_human_id]", "S'en charge par défaut", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
            = select_tag "kitchen[#{key}][default_human_id]",
                         options_from_collection_for_select(@humans, :id, :name, Kitchen::Config.default_human(key)&.id),
                         include_blank: "— Personne —",
                         class: "mt-1 w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm sm:text-sm"
          div
            = label_tag "kitchen[#{key}][max_people]", "Plafond de convives", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
            = number_field_tag "kitchen[#{key}][max_people]", Kitchen::Config.max_people(key), min: 1, placeholder: "Aucun", class: "mt-1 w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm sm:text-sm"
            p.mt-1.text-xs.text-gray-400 Au-delà, un avertissement à la saisie.
          div
            = label_tag "kitchen[#{key}][lead_days]", "Délai minimum (jours)", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
            = number_field_tag "kitchen[#{key}][lead_days]", Kitchen::Config.lead_days(key), min: 0, placeholder: "Aucun", class: "mt-1 w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm sm:text-sm"
            p.mt-1.text-xs.text-gray-400 En deçà, un avertissement à la saisie.

    section.bg-white.rounded-2xl.ring-1.ring-gray-200.px-5.py-4
      = label_tag "kitchen[coordinator_email]", "Email de coordination", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
      p.mt-0.5.text-sm.text-gray-500 Prévenu quand la cuisine refuse une demande ou se désiste.
      = email_field_tag "kitchen[coordinator_email]", Kitchen::Config.coordinator_email, class: "mt-2 w-full sm:max-w-sm rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm sm:text-sm"

    .flex.justify-end
      button.inline-flex.items-center.rounded-md.px-4.py-2.text-sm.font-medium.text-white.shadow-sm.bg-4s-main(class="hover:opacity-90" type="submit")
        | Enregistrer
